#: pretix_countdown/templates/pretix_countdown/settings.html:8
msgid ""
"The countdown uses the start of presale and the \"Available from\" dates you "
"already set for the event and its products. When a countdown reaches zero, "
"the page reloads so visitors can buy right away."
